<title>FRANCE: Valeo says Jan-April sales 11.3 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Valeo says Jan-April sales 11.3 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French car parts supplier Valeo on Wednesday reported a 13 percent rise in sales for the first four months of the year to 11.3 billion francs.</p>
<p>Chairman Noel Goutard told a shareholders meeting that three percentage points of the rise reflected the favourable impact of exchange rates and that 4.5 points were due to the expanded structure of the group.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
